<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Geometry Lab handles data: no accounts, calculations in your browser, Google Analytics visit statistics, Adsterra advertising, and how to opt out."><article class="article"><div class="eyebrow">Privacy policy</div><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p class="small-note">Last updated: October 21, 2026</p><p>Geometry Lab is free to use and needs no account. This page explains what happens to data when you visit geometrylab.net.</p>
<h2>What you enter</h2><p>Calculator, solver, and worksheet inputs are processed in your browser. They are not sent to a Geometry Lab server.</p>
<h2>Data saved on your device</h2><p>Practice best scores are saved in your browser’s local storage so you can see them next time. They stay on your device and are removed when you clear your browser data.</p>
<h2>Usage statistics</h2><p>We use Google Analytics (measurement ID G-9CCD0H600F) to count visits and see which pages are useful. Google Analytics uses cookies or similar identifiers and collects information such as the pages viewed, the referring site, your approximate location, and your device and browser type. We use this only to improve the site.</p>
<h2>Advertising</h2><p>Ads are served by Adsterra and its advertising partners. To show and measure ads, they may use cookies or similar identifiers and receive information such as your IP address, device and browser type, and the page you are visiting. Their use of that data is covered by their own privacy policies. Ads load in clearly labeled spaces, and we do not use pop-ups or full-screen ads.</p>
<h2>Other services</h2><p>Fonts are loaded from Google Fonts. Our hosting provider processes standard access logs, such as IP address and requested page, to deliver and protect the site.</p>
<h2>Your choices</h2><ul><li>Block or delete cookies in your browser settings. The calculators keep working without them.</li><li>Use an ad or tracker blocker to stop ads and analytics from loading.</li><li>Install Google’s <a class="text-link" href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.</li><li>Clear your browser’s site data to remove saved practice scores.</li></ul>
<h2>Children</h2><p>Geometry Lab is an educational site for students and teachers. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children, and the site has no sign-up or contact forms.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about privacy? Email <a class="text-link" href="mailto:info@geometrylab.net">info@geometrylab.net</a>.</p></article></Layout>
